  "fullDescription": "Cute Baby Unicorn Clipart – Kawaii Magic Rainbow SVG Bundle\nEnter a world of magic and dreams with our ultra-cute “Baby Unicorn” collection!\n​Celebrate fantasy and joy with these adorable little unicorns, perfect for bringing a sweet, kawaii touch to your children’s projects. This high-quality vector set features a variety of baby unicorns with pastel rainbow manes and tails, interacting with sweet elements like sparkling hearts, magical butterflies, a shimmering moon and stars, and plenty of precious gems. Set is ideal for nursery decor, birthday celebrations, and playful school crafts.\n​⚠️ ATTENTION FOR DESIGNERS (Clipping Masks Inside):\n​Please note that some detailed vector elements in the master AI and EPS source files utilize Clipping Masks to maintain perfect geometric shapes, sharp borders, and layered details.\n​For editing or recoloring paths: You may need to right-click the element and select “Release Clipping Mask” in Adobe Illustrator or Linearity Curve to modify the base shapes and colors.\n​For standard use: The SVG and PNG files are fully expanded, merged, and ready for immediate printing or digital layout use.\n​What’s Included in this Magical Pack:\n​9 Charming Baby Unicorn Characters: Posing on a cloud, leaping over a rainbow, sitting, winking, and playing.\n​Magical Accents & Elements: Shimmering diamonds, winged hearts, magical butterflies, a rainbow, and a moon with a stars pendant.\n​24 Unique Elements Total (as indicated by the “24” tag on the preview).\n​​Formats: AI, EPS, SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) & PNG (High-Resolution 300 DPI with Transparent Background).\n​Perfect For: Children’s birthday invitations, sublimation on t-shirts and mugs, nursery wall art, planner stickers, teacher resources, and digital scrapbooking.\n​Design Note: These files are optimized for high-quality printing and digital creative layouts (Print & Cut). Due to the fine details and pattern-based vector masks, they are best suited for flat graphic designs rather than complex, multi-layered vinyl cutting.",
